  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Circular fashion and textile seminar, workshop and masterclass at the Lagos Fashion Week (CERF24NG6O)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Goal of this projectThe organisation of a circular fashion and textile seminar, workshop and masterclass at the Lagos Fashion Week.Holland Circular Hotspot organised these events with Dutch experts from the University of Groningen and Cooloo, a company that upcycles waste materials, together with the Nigerian stakeholders Style House Files, Circular Business Platform and the Office of Climate Change and Circular Economy of Lagos State and the Netherlands consulate-general (CG) in Lagos.The overall purpose of this assignment was to investigate collaboration opportunities between the Netherlands and Nigeria in the field of circular fashion and textiles, both at the business and government levels and on knowledge development.</narrative>
  </description>
